SUMMARY:Wednesday Morning's Breakfast Rides  Casual Pace Variable Distance
  RSVP
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Every Wednesday morning
 ...Ride and eat Yummy breakfast together.**\n\n**Please do not go on this 
 ride unless you will ride at a casual pace and stay with the group . We wi
 ll meet to ride to breakfast at a casual pace. After eating some may split
  up with some returning to the start and others going longer and faster.**
 \n**Helmets are mandatory\; No ear buds or audible music playing devices. 
 Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pu
 mp/CO2 inflator).**\n**To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\
 , we encourage LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride
 . RSVP also allows us to contact you after the ride if needed. If you do n
 ot RSVP you are not covered by the club excess accident insurance policy\;
  only club members who RSVP are covered. Being on Meetup does not mean you
  are a club member. Join here-** [https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n**Richard Conner\, leader717-572-8480**
