SUMMARY:LBC Bike to 30K Program: Cycling Nutrition 
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThe Bike to 30K is hostin
 g a class with Trek Bikes on Cycling Nutrition. Join us for this informati
 onal program!\n\n**Grab your helmets\, bikes\, and sneakers — Lancaster 
 Bicycle Club is gearing up for beginner and transitional rides!** Local me
 mbers of the LBC are thrilled to host this year’s **Bike to 30K Program*
 *\, designed especially for new\, returning\, and curious cyclists.\n## **
 About the Program**\nBike to 30K is a seven‑week series that gently buil
 ds your confidence\, fitness\, and mileage. We begin with a five‑mile ri
 de and gradually work up to eighteen miles by the end of the program. Our 
 goal is simple: to introduce riders of all experience levels to the joy of
  cycling in a supportive\, community‑focused environment.\nThis program 
 is **FREE** with an LBC membership — and membership is also free. The Bi
 ke to 30K program is open to everyone in our community who wants to ride.\
 n## **Why We Ride**\nEver wonder why cyclists keep coming back? Because it
 ’s fun. There’s nothing like coasting downhill and letting out a big 
 “weeeeeee” all the way to the bottom. But we also know that if you’r
 e new to cycling\, jumping straight into an 18‑mile ride can feel intimi
 dating. That’s exactly why Bike to 30K exists.\nEach week\, you’ll inc
 rease your mileage at a comfortable pace. You’ll get to know the club\, 
 meet fellow riders\, and gradually grow into a confident **Fun Rider** —
  the group known for enjoying scenic\, social rides together.\n## **Our Co
 mmitment to You**\nLancaster Bicycle Club is dedicated to supporting new r
 iders and helping our community reach their cycling goals. Bike to 30K is 
 part of our initiative to encourage more people to get outside\, get activ
 e\, and discover how enjoyable cycling can be.\nSpend seven weeks with us 
 and watch yourself transform into a Fun Rider — one mile at a time.\nThe
  Bike to 30K program is voluntary\, welcoming\, and designed with beginner
 s in mind. We can’t wait to ride with you.\n## **Membership\, Waiver & R
 SVP Requirements**\nTo eliminate passing around a pen‑and‑paper waiver
 \, we require both:\n\n* **LBC Club Membership**\, and\n* **Meetup RSVP**\
 n\nYour RSVP allows us to contact you after the ride if needed. Please not
 e: **ONLY club members who RSVP are covered by the club’s excess acciden
 t insurance policy.** Being on Meetup does *not* mean you are a club membe
 r. To join our wonderful club\, please sign up through our membership link
 .
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3132641
 80/
