SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU: EC Reuben’s Challenge (42M)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nGot a big hilly event com
 ing up that you are way undertrained for? Yes\, then this is the ride for 
 you!\n\nRide Leader: *Bruce Black*\nRide Sweep: *CP Weaver*\nRide leader a
 verage speed: 12-18 mph\n\nRoute: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cu
 e/ec-reubens-challenge-42m/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ec-r
 eubens-challenge-42m/)\n\n**The ride leader will ride at a pace to meet th
 e advertised average speed for the course.** Some riders may choose to rid
 e faster or slower than the ride leader(s). The ride leader(s) may attempt
  to regroup at certain points along the course. Be sure you have the cours
 e cue just in case.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring wat
 er and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\
 n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Clu
 b membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup d
 oes not mean you are a club member.\n\n[Join here](https://www.lancasterbi
 keclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your ag
 reement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.club
 express.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\,\n\n
 [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page
 _id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancas
 terbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3145060
 30/
