SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Snake Hill Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Cue and GPX link:** [Phil's Hills: Snake Hill Repeats](https://ridewithgps
 .com/routes/53989696)\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a total di
 stance of approximately **15-20 miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of a cir
 cuit featuring **1-2 climbing segment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasize mai
 ntaining a consistent climbing tempo\, active recovery between efforts\, a
 nd repeating the effort to build power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** We'll 
 maintain a comfortable average pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-Drop P
 olicy:** You'll never be left behind! We'll regroup after climbs to ensure
  everyone stays together.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbud
 s or audible music-playing devices. Please bring water\, and a basic repai
 r kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3142079
 08/
